<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45326" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">stemma</span></b> , ătis,
		n., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στέμμα</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen., <i>a
			garland</i>, <i>wreath</i> (post-class.), Prud.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεφ</span>. 10, 908; Firm. Math. 3,
			8.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> In
			partic., <i>a garland</i> hung upon an ancestral image
			(post-Aug.), <i><span class="en">Sen. Ben. 3, 28, 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 35, 2,
				2, § 6</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>a pedigree</i>,
				<i>genealogical table</i>, <i>genealogical tree</i>, <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep.
				44, 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Suet. Ner. 37</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id.
				Galb. 2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Stat. S. 3, 3, 43</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Pers. 3,
			28</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Juv. 8, 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Mart. 5,
				35, 4</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>nobility</i>, <i>high value</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">argenti fumosa sui stemmata narrare,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart.
					8, 6, 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">referre prisci jejunii,</span>”
				<i>the great antiquity</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Prud. Cath. 7, 81</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
